BT /F1 11 Tf 56 786 Td (Master Data Processing Agreement \(DEMO DATA — fictional contract\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 767 Td (This is a wholly fictional agreement between two fictional companies,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 748 Td (written only to demonstrate ClauseTrace. It creates no legal obligations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 729 Td (1 Parties) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 704 Td (This Master Data Processing Agreement is entered into by Beacon Retail Pvt Ltd) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 689 Td (\("Beacon", the Data Fiduciary\) and Stratus Analytics Pvt Ltd \("Stratus", the Data) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 674 Td (Processor\), both fictional companies incorporated in India.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 655 Td (2 Definitions) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 630 Td ("Personal Data" means data about an individual who is identifiable by or in relation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 615 Td (to such data. "Processing" means any operation performed on Personal Data,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 600 Td (including collection, storage, analysis and erasure. "Breach" means any) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 585 Td (unauthorised access to or loss of Personal Data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 566 Td (3 Scope of processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 541 Td (Stratus shall process Personal Data only for order fulfilment and delivery) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 526 Td (updates on Beacon's retail platform, and for no other purpose unless this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 511 Td (agreement is amended in writing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 492 Td (4 Purpose limitation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 467 Td (Stratus shall not use Personal Data for advertising, profiling or any purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 452 Td (incompatible with order fulfilment and delivery updates. Any new purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 437 Td (requires Beacon's prior written approval.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 418 Td (5 Data categories) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 393 Td (The Personal Data covered are customer name, contact details, delivery address) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 378 Td (and order history. Stratus shall not collect or retain any data beyond what) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 363 Td (these categories require.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 344 Td (6 Security safeguards) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 319 Td (Stratus shall protect Personal Data with encryption in transit and at rest,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 304 Td (role-based access control, and continuous logging and monitoring of access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 289 Td (Stratus shall review these measures at least once a year and fix gaps without) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 274 Td (delay.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 255 Td (7 Processor engagement) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 230 Td (Stratus acts only on Beacon's documented instructions and only under this valid) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 215 Td (contract. Stratus shall not appoint a sub-processor without Beacon's prior) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 200 Td (written consent, and shall flow these obligations down to any approved) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 185 Td (sub-processor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 56 166 Td (8 Sub-processors) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 141 Td (The approved sub-processors are listed in Schedule 1. Stratus shall inform) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 126 Td (Beacon before any change to that list and shall remain fully responsible for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 111 Td (every sub-processor's compliance.) Tj ET
